WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:09.179
Roxy couldn't see anything in the blinding light as she flew down and landed.

2
00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.905
A kind old woman greeted her.

3
00:00:11.906 --> 00:00:14.711
"My name is Rocket Girl," Roxy said.

4
00:00:14.712 --> 00:00:17.459
"I'm looking for the bodhisattva Guanyin.

5
00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:21.561
Someone told me she lives on Mount Potalaka in the South Sea."

6
00:00:21.562 --> 00:00:25.593
The woman nodded. "Yes, the bodhisattva lives there."

7
00:00:25.594 --> 00:00:31.157
"I flew all over the South Sea, but I didn't see the mountain," Roxy said.

8
00:00:31.158 --> 00:00:36.391
"You're not a spirit, so you can't travel to Mount Potalaka," the woman said.

9
00:00:36.392 --> 00:00:39.928
"But that's okay. I know why you're here."

10
00:00:39.929 --> 00:00:42.752
"You do?" Roxy said, surprised.

11
00:00:42.753 --> 00:00:48.583
"Yes," the woman said. "I also know that your real name is Roxy."

12
00:00:48.584 --> 00:00:51.084
Roxy gasped.

13
00:00:51.085 --> 00:00:56.564
"Don't worry, I will protect your secret," the woman said.

14
00:00:56.565 --> 00:01:01.068
Bright light flashed, and the woman disappeared.

15
00:01:01.069 --> 00:01:07.714
Then Roxy was back up in the sky, and a bird spirit appeared next to her.

16
00:01:07.715 --> 00:01:15.217
"I am Swift Wing, and I can open the portal for you," the spirit said. "Come!"

17
00:01:15.218 --> 00:01:20.586
Roxy quickly caught up to the spirit. "Who was that woman?"

18
00:01:20.587 --> 00:01:24.937
"She is the bodhisattva Guanyin," Swift Wing said.

19
00:01:24.938 --> 00:01:32.037
"You're not a spirit, so you can't see her in her true form."

20
00:01:32.038 --> 00:01:36.781
Roxy and Swift Wing soared through the air and found the Tang Monk and Wujing.

21
00:01:36.782 --> 00:01:43.325
The Tang Monk gasped. "Swift Wing! You look like a kind spirit now."

22
00:01:43.326 --> 00:01:46.083
Swift Wing spread her wings.

23
00:01:46.084 --> 00:01:49.722
"The bodhisattva Guanyin is teaching me to be good.

24
00:01:49.723 --> 00:01:55.659
I'm not evil anymore, and I feel much happier."

25
00:01:55.660 --> 00:02:05.136
Swift Wing recited a spell. Zoomp! The portal opened.

26
00:02:05.137 --> 00:02:11.213
*** "This is great!" Wukong said. "I've missed ruling over a kingdom."

27
00:02:11.214 --> 00:02:15.333
A large platform sat outside, in front of City Hall.

28
00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:19.359
In the center of the platform, Wukong sat on a magnificent throne.

29
00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:25.328
Monkeys and apes stood behind him, and Bajie was next to him.

30
00:02:25.329 --> 00:02:28.770
"I agree, Wukong," Bajie said proudly.

31
00:02:28.771 --> 00:02:32.536
"This is much more fun than traveling to the west."

32
00:02:32.537 --> 00:02:35.704
A crowd of people had gathered in the street.

33
00:02:35.705 --> 00:02:41.236
Mayor Bloom was there. Terrell, Jack, and Mara were in the crowd too.

34
00:02:41.237 --> 00:02:45.980
"All hail Sun Wukong!" a gorilla shouted.

35
00:02:45.981 --> 00:02:52.827
The monkeys and apes cheered.

36
00:02:52.828 --> 00:02:57.156
"King of the Fruit and Flower Mountain!" the gorilla cried.

37
00:02:57.157 --> 00:03:04.340
The monkeys and apes cheered again.

38
00:03:04.341 --> 00:03:08.547
"King of Metro City!" the gorilla cried.

39
00:03:08.548 --> 00:03:16.523
The monkeys and apes cheered even more loudly as the gorilla shouted, "Everyone, bow before your new king!"

40
00:03:16.524 --> 00:03:20.473
All the people bowed. Many looked nervous.

41
00:03:20.474 --> 00:03:25.102
"I don't like Sun Wukong or the pig anymore," Jack whispered.

42
00:03:25.103 --> 00:03:29.989
Terrell nodded. "I wish Rocket Girl was here to stop them."

43
00:03:29.990 --> 00:03:34.442
"Who brought gifts for the Monkey King?" the gorilla asked.

44
00:03:34.443 --> 00:03:37.066
One by one, citizens stepped forward.

45
00:03:37.067 --> 00:03:43.745
Mara, Terrell, and Jack watched as people placed gifts in front of Wukong.

46
00:03:43.746 --> 00:03:47.222
A man from True Savings Bank presented sacks of money.

47
00:03:47.223 --> 00:03:50.505
A jewelry store owner handed over a diamond necklace.

48
00:03:50.506 --> 00:03:53.693
A baker brought cookies, muffins, and a large cake.

49
00:03:53.694 --> 00:03:57.297
The owner of Metro City Pizza walked up with several pizzas.

50
00:03:57.298 --> 00:04:02.346
Bajie's mouth watered. "Yum!"

51
00:04:02.347 --> 00:04:07.001
The gorilla cleared his throat. "All hail the—"

52
00:04:07.002 --> 00:04:10.546
"Sun Wukong stinks!" someone shouted.

53
00:04:10.547 --> 00:04:12.338
Everyone gasped.

54
00:04:12.339 --> 00:04:15.978
Mara pointed. "Rocket Girl!"

55
00:04:15.979 --> 00:04:24.850
Roxy floated over the crowd. "You're not our king, Wukong!"

